<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>CyberWriter Latest Version | Markdown Studio for Mac, iPhone & iPad</title><meta name="description" content="CyberWriter is a native Markdown studio with WYSIWYG editing, knowledge graphs, AI, charts, diagrams, terminal tools and PDF, Word and HTML export."><meta name="keywords" content="CyberWriter, Markdown Studio, Markdown editor Mac, knowledge graph, AI writing app"><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#07111f;color:#eaf6ff;line-height:1.7}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.container{width:min(1120px,92%);margin:auto}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;background:rgba(5,13,25,.95);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid #17364c}.nav{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:800}.mark{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#11bfff,#1677ff)}.logo small{display:block;color:#7f9bb3;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.5px}nav{display:flex;gap:24px;color:#a9c1d5;font-size:14px}.hero{padding:92px 0 65px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,#123d62,transparent 50%)}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 13px;border:1px solid #28627f;border-radius:999px;color:#54d5ff;background:#1e96ff12;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px}h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,68px);line-height:1.05;margin:20px 0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#65d8ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}.hero p{max-width:800px;margin:auto;color:#a9bed0;font-size:18px}.buttons{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}.btn{padding:13px 22px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:800;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16bfff,#126ef3)}.btn.alt{background:#0b1a2d;color:#b9d4e8}.stats{padding:25px 0;background:#091628;border-block:1px solid #173047}.stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;text-align:center}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:18px}.stat span{font-size:12px;color:#7590a7}section{padding:78px 0}.title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:42px}.title h2{font-size:34px;margin:0 0 10px}.title p{color:#89a5bb}.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.card,.panel{padding:27px;border:1px solid #17374d;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#0b1a2c,#091522);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 15px 45px #00000029}.icon{font-size:28px}.card h3{margin:8px 0}.card p,.about p,details p{color:#91a9bc;font-size:14px}.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:35px;align-items:center}.about h2{font-size:36px}.checks{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:20px}.checks div{padding:11px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:#0b1c2f;color:#bed0de}.info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.info div{padding:14px;background:#0d2034;border-radius:12px}.info b{display:block;color:#5ed7ff;font-size:12px}.cta{text-align:center;padding:65px 25px;border-radius:24px;background:#0a1a2c;border:1px solid #1b4963}.faq{max-width:850px;margin:auto}details{background:#0b1a2b;border:1px solid #17374d;border-radius:13px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:17px 20px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}footer{padding:35px 0;color:#70899f;border-top:1px solid #173047;font-size:13px;text-align:center}@media(max-width:800px){nav{display:none}.features,.about{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stats-grid,.info{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:520px){.stats-grid,.info{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style></head><body><header><div class="container nav"><div class="logo"><div class="mark">CW</div><div>cyberWriter<small>MARKDOWN STUDIO</small></div></div><nav><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#info">Info</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a></nav></div></header><main><section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="badge">MARKDOWN · AI · KNOWLEDGE GRAPH</span><h1>CyberWriter Latest Version</h1><p>A native Markdown studio for Mac, iPhone and iPad with WYSIWYG editing, linked notes, live charts, diagrams, AI tools, a built-in terminal and professional document export.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="btn" href="https://cyberwriter.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official Website</a><a class="btn alt" href="#features">Explore Features</a></div></div></section><section class="stats"><div class="container stats-grid"><div class="stat"><strong>Mac</strong><span>macOS 15+</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>iPhone/iPad</strong><span>iOS/iPadOS 17+</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Price</strong><span>$14.99 One-Time</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>Developer</strong><span>John Taverna</span></div></div></section><section id="features"><div class="container"><div class="title"><h2>Key Features</h2><p>A complete writing and knowledge workspace without third-party plugins.</p></div><div class="features"><div class="card"><div class="icon">✍️</div><h3>True WYSIWYG Markdown</h3><p>Write formatted documents directly while your files remain ordinary Markdown. Switch between rich editing and raw source when needed.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">🔗</div><h3>Vault & Knowledge Graph</h3><p>Use Wikilinks, backlinks, tags and an interactive 3D graph to connect and explore notes across your vault.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">🤖</div><h3>Your Own AI</h3><p>Use Apple Intelligence, local models or your own compatible API keys. AI can draft, rewrite, summarize and explain within your documents.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">📊</div><h3>Charts, Math & Diagrams</h3><p>Render Mermaid diagrams, KaTeX equations and Vega/Vega-Lite charts directly inside documents.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">⌨️</div><h3>GLOW Terminal</h3><p>A built-in terminal works with your vault using familiar commands plus vault-aware operations and optional AI assistance.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon">📄</div><h3>Professional Export</h3><p>Export to PDF, Word and HTML without installing Pandoc or LaTeX, with control over themes, fonts, margins and page breaks.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="about"><div class="container about"><div><h2>Your Markdown, Your Files</h2><p>CyberWriter keeps your vault as a normal folder of Markdown files, making notes portable and compatible with existing Markdown workflows. The official site specifically describes compatibility with existing Obsidian vaults.</p><p>Beyond writing, the app combines live document rendering, linked notes, drawings, voice notes, slides, flash cards and data-driven content in one native application.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Built Into One App</h3><div class="checks"><div>✓ Excalidraw canvas</div><div>✓ Voice notes and on-device transcription</div><div>✓ Slides and spaced-repetition flash cards</div><div>✓ Snippets and media embeds</div><div>✓ Search by files, tags, content or concepts</div></div></div></div></section><section id="info"><div class="container"><div class="title"><h2>Software Information</h2><p>Current details from the official site and App Store listing.</p></div><div class="panel"><div class="info"><div><b>MAC VERSION</b>3.97</div><div><b>MAC REQUIREMENT</b>macOS 15+</div><div><b>IOS VERSION</b>1.2</div><div><b>IOS REQUIREMENT</b>iOS/iPadOS 17+</div><div><b>PRICE</b>$14.99 one-time</div><div><b>DEVELOPER</b>John Taverna</div></div><h3 style="margin-top:28px">Before You Start</h3><div class="checks"><div>✓ Choose or create a Markdown vault folder.</div><div>✓ Existing Markdown vaults can be opened and kept as normal files.</div><div>✓ AI is optional and can use local or cloud providers you configure.</div><div>✓ Mac and iOS purchases are separate according to the official site.</div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="container"><div class="cta"><h2>Build a Smarter Markdown Workspace</h2><p style="color:#91a9bc;margin:12px auto 24px">Visit the official CyberWriter website to explore the current release, pricing and supported Apple platforms.</p><a class="btn" href="https://cyberwriter.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit CyberWriter</a></div></div></section><section id="faq"><div class="container"><div class="title"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Common questions about CyberWriter.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>What is CyberWriter?</summary><p>CyberWriter is a native Markdown studio that combines document editing, knowledge management, AI, diagrams, charts, terminal tools and export features.</p></details><details><summary>Does CyberWriter support existing Obsidian vaults?</summary><p>Yes. The official site says you can point CyberWriter at an existing vault and continue using it alongside Obsidian.</p></details><details><summary>Does CyberWriter require a subscription?</summary><p>No. The official site lists a $14.99 one-time purchase. Mac and iOS are separate purchases.</p></details><details><summary>Does CyberWriter have AI?</summary><p>Yes. It supports Apple Intelligence, local models and configured cloud/API providers. AI features are available inside the editor and GLOW terminal.</p></details><details><summary>Can I export documents?</summary><p>Yes. CyberWriter supports PDF, Word and HTML export, without requiring Pandoc or LaTeX.</p></details><details><summary>Is CyberWriter offline?</summary><p>Core editing, rendering, search, knowledge graph and other local features work on-device. Network access is used when you choose cloud AI or run a live API block.</p></details></div></div></section></main><footer><div class="container">© 2026 CyberWriter Guide. This page is for informational purposes. Product details can change with future releases.</div></footer></body></html>
